# Contact form → admin email via Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Enter the admin email on web3forms.com to get a free access key
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below (for local testing)
# 3. On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY, then redeploy
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
